    <sys:String x:Key="ExtendedKeys_Loading">Reading extended keys from the keyboard…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ExtendedKeys_WriteFailed">The keyboard did not accept the last extended-key change — the list shows what it actually holds. Try again; if it keeps failing, this keyboard's firmware may not support extended keys.</sys:String>
